    "title": "Residents voice support for Newport's moratorium approval on data center - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Elise Sandlin ,\n7 hours ago NEWPORT, CARTERET COUNTY, N.C. (WITN) - While data centers remain a divided issue nationally, one town in the East has chosen to delay development in their area. The Newport Town Council has approved a moratorium on data center development, which is set to remain in place for at least a year. Read full article\n1",
